@startuml ingestion-states
' IngestionStatus (core) values confirmed unchanged: RECEIVED, PROCESSING,
' FAILED, COMPLETED — no new states.
[*] --> RECEIVED : createJob()\n(se autoProcess=true, publica IngestionJobEvent\nno tópico Kafka "ingestion.jobs")
RECEIVED --> PROCESSING : IngestionEventConsumer consome o evento\n-> IngestionService.processJob() -> AbstractIngestionProcessor.process()
PROCESSING --> COMPLETED : doProcess() concluído sem excepção
PROCESSING --> FAILED : excepção em doProcess()\n(estado gravado com REQUIRES_NEW,\nnunca é revertido pela transacção falhada)
RECEIVED --> FAILED : @RetryableTopic esgota as 3 tentativas\n-> mensagem em "ingestion.jobs.dlt"\n-> @DltHandler.markJobFailed()
COMPLETED --> [*]
FAILED --> [*]
@enduml
